      "writtenOn": "2026-03-05T17:45:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we saw some random usage that was triggering us to use more than 512 of a specific descriptor type, I\u0027m not sure we would actually take any action on it. Like this should be a very rare number to hit in general and things will continue to work fine if it is hit. So I guess I lean towards not needing any sort of log warning here.",
